# --- secret hygiene (propagated 2026-08-01, shared across the four trading repos) ---
# *.key, *.pem, credentials.json and secrets.json are already covered above.
# .env* is broader than the explicit .env.* list; the carve-outs follow it so
# templates stay committable (last matching pattern wins).
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
# stray editor/OS duplicates that slip narrower .env rules
* - Copy.*
*- Copy.*
